msgstr "URL de GitLab"

#: templates/config.html.twig
msgid "Access token"
msgstr "Jeton d'accès"

#: templates/config.html.twig
msgid "(unchanged)"
msgstr "(inchangé)"

#: templates/config.html.twig
msgid "A project or group access token with the \"api\" scope and the Reporter role (or more) is enough. It is stored encrypted."
msgstr "Un jeton d'accès de projet ou de groupe avec le périmètre « api » et le rôle Reporter (ou supérieur) suffit. Il est stocké chiffré."

#: templates/config.html.twig
msgid "Save and test the connection"
msgstr "Enregistrer et tester la connexion"

#: templates/config.html.twig
msgid "Issue creation"
msgstr "Création d'issue"

#: templates/config.html.twig
msgid "Default project"
msgstr "Projet par défaut"

#: templates/config.html.twig
msgid "Issue title"
msgstr "Titre de l'issue"

#: templates/config.html.twig
msgid "Placeholders: {id} (ticket number) and {title}."
msgstr "Variables : {id} (numéro du ticket) et {title}."

#: templates/config.html.twig
msgid "Default labels"
msgstr "Labels par défaut"

#: templates/config.html.twig
msgid "Comma separated."
msgstr "Séparés par des virgules."

#: templates/config.html.twig
msgid "Create confidential issues"
msgstr "Créer des issues confidentielles"

#: templates/config.html.twig
msgid "Mention requesters and assignees in the issue"
msgstr "Mentionner les demandeurs et les attributaires dans l'issue"

#: templates/config.html.twig
msgid "Add a followup to the ticket when the issue is created"
msgstr "Ajouter un suivi au ticket à la création de l'issue"

#: templates/config.html.twig
msgid "Private followup"
msgstr "Suivi privé"

#: templates/config.html.twig
msgid "When an issue is created, add a public followup (the technician can change this for each issue)"
msgstr "À la création d'une issue, ajouter un suivi public (le technicien peut le modifier pour chaque issue)"

#: templates/config.html.twig
msgid "Message to the requester"
msgstr "Message au demandeur"

#: templates/config.html.twig
msgid "Plain text. Empty = default message."
msgstr "Texte brut. Vide = message par défaut."

#: templates/config.html.twig
msgid "Copy the ticket attachments and images to GitLab"
msgstr "Copier les pièces jointes et images du ticket vers GitLab"

#: templates/config.html.twig
msgid "Maximum attachment size (MB)"
msgstr "Taille maximale des pièces jointes (Mo)"

#: templates/config.html.twig
msgid "When the issue is closed on GitLab"
msgstr "Quand l'issue est fermée sur GitLab"

#: templates/config.html.twig
msgid "For technicians"
msgstr "Pour les techniciens"

#: templates/config.html.twig
msgid "Add a followup with the GitLab details (who closed the issue, when, merge requests)"
msgstr "Ajouter un suivi avec les détails GitLab (qui a fermé l'issue, quand, merge requests)"

#: templates/config.html.twig
msgid "For the requester"
msgstr "Pour le demandeur"

#: templates/config.html.twig
msgid "Requesters, who are often not technicians, never see the GitLab tab. These neutral public messages tell them that their request was forwarded and completed, without any GitLab detail (project, developer, link). GLPI notifications apply to public followups."
msgstr "Les demandeurs, souvent non techniciens, ne voient jamais l'onglet GitLab. Ces messages publics neutres leur indiquent que leur demande a été transmise puis traitée, sans aucun détail GitLab (projet, développeur, lien). Les notifications GLPI s'appliquent aux suivis publics."

#: templates/config.html.twig
msgid "Nothing"
msgstr "Rien"

#: templates/config.html.twig
msgid "A public followup with the message below"
msgstr "Un suivi public avec le message ci-dessous"

#: templates/config.html.twig
msgid "The ticket is solved, with the message below as the solution (notifications and automatic actions apply)"
msgstr "Le ticket est résolu, avec le message ci-dessous comme solution (les notifications et actions automatiques s'appliquent)"

#: templates/config.html.twig
msgid "Solution type (when the ticket is solved)"
msgstr "Type de solution (quand le ticket est résolu)"

#: templates/config.html.twig
msgid "Advanced: custom solution text"
msgstr "Avancé : texte de solution personnalisé"

#: templates/config.html.twig
msgid "Optional. Replaces the message above as the text of the solution (HTML allowed). Placeholders: {issue}, {issue_url}, {closed_by}, {closed_at}, {ticket_id}. They show GitLab details to the requester."
msgstr "Facultatif. Remplace le message ci-dessus comme texte de la solution (HTML autorisé). Variables : {issue}, {issue_url}, {closed_by}, {closed_at}, {ticket_id}. Elles montrent des détails GitLab au demandeur."

#: templates/config.html.twig
msgid "Author"
msgstr "Auteur"

#: templates/config.html.twig
msgid "Author of the automatic followups and solutions"
msgstr "Auteur des suivis et solutions automatiques"

#: templates/config.html.twig
msgid "The user who created the issue"
msgstr "L'utilisateur qui a créé l'issue"

#: templates/config.html.twig
msgid "Rights by profile"
msgstr "Droits par profil"

#: templates/config.html.twig
msgid "Rights are cumulative: \"Read\" is required for the others. The same rights can be edited in the \"GitLab issues\" tab of each profile (Administration > Profiles). Self-service profiles cannot use the plugin."
msgstr "Les droits sont cumulatifs : « Lecture » est requise pour les autres. Les mêmes droits se modifient dans l'onglet « Issues GitLab » de chaque profil (Administration > Profils). Les profils self-service ne peuvent pas utiliser le plugin."

#: templates/config.html.twig
msgid "Profile"
msgstr "Profil"

#: templates/config.html.twig
msgid "You need the update right on profiles to change these rights."
msgstr "Il faut le droit de modification sur les profils pour changer ces droits."

#: templates/config.html.twig
msgid "Save the rights"
msgstr "Enregistrer les droits"

#: templates/config.html.twig
msgid "Search a project…"
msgstr "Rechercher un projet…"

